{"id":"166ecddb12d25dfc","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-polynomial-advice.md","title":"多项式建议与受限一致性","display":"df-polynomial-advice — 多项式建议与受限一致性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-polynomial-advice","aliases":["29-df-polynomial-advice"],"display":"df-polynomial-advice — 多项式建议与受限一致性","depends_on":["[[29-df-turing-machine]]"],"source_locator":"Definition11.17 and following discussion; Exercise11.18(1), pp.176–177, DjVu scans191–192","source_basis":"文本层已逐项对照；用二进制语言与显式配对编码重构建议接口","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-polynomial-advice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-polynomial-advice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-advice — 多项式建议与受限一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition11.17 and following discussion; Exercise11.18(1), pp.176–177, DjVu scans191–192"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"文本层已逐项对照；用二进制语言与显式配对编码重构建议接口"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)\">\\(C,D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)\\)</span> 是二进制语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^*\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。配对编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 由下式固定，保证两个分量可恢复。</li>\n<li>建议函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 只依赖输入长度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_f,\\mathrm{Bit}_f\">\\(\\ell_f,\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\)</span> 是下式定义的二进制语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a> 的显式二进制表示，局部记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bin}\">\\(\\mathrm{bin}\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)[i]\">\\(f(n)[i]\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0\">\\(i=0\\)</span> 起编号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f)\\)</span> 通过某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in C\">\\(K\\in C\\)</span> 在实际建议图上判定，不约束错误建议上的结果；这是语言接口，区别于结构大小的建议接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>-一致性在本地实现中分别要求长度比较图和置位图属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\\mathrm{bin}(n)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\\mathrm{bin}(n)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\coloneqq1^{|x|}0xy.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\coloneqq1^{|x|}0xy.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{\\mathbb N}\\mid\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;|f(n)|\\leq p(n+1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{\\mathbb N}\\mid\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;|f(n)|\\leq p(n+1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists K\\in C\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,f(|x|)\\rangle\\in K)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists K\\in C\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,f(|x|)\\rangle\\in K)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C/\\mathrm{poly}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}}\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C/\\mathrm{poly}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}}\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_f\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\mathrm{bin}(n),\\mathrm{bin}(i)\\rangle\\mid n,i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;|f(n)|\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\mathrm{bin}(n),\\mathrm{bin}(i)\\rangle\\mid n,i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;|f(n)|,\\ f(n)[i]=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_f\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\mathrm{bin}(n),\\mathrm{bin}(i)\\rangle\\mid n,i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;|f(n)|\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\mathrm{bin}(n),\\mathrm{bin}(i)\\rangle\\mid n,i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;|f(n)|,\\ f(n)[i]=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}(C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\substack{f\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\\\\\ell_f,\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\in D}}\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}(C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\substack{f\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\\\\\ell_f,\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\in D}}\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition11.17 以查询和输入大小叙述建议，随后以可计算数值谓词解释受限一致性。本条采用二进制语言及输入长度版本，明确写出oracle语言在错误建议上的自由度；不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle x,f(|x|)\\rangle:x\\in L\\}\\in C\">\\(\\{\\langle x,f(|x|)\\rangle:x\\in L\\}\\in C\\)</span> 当作定义，因为那会要求识别任意复杂函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的完整图。原书式子应依通常“给定正确建议时识别”的解释理解。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>-一致性的位图表示同时给出长度，避免全零字符串的不同长度在置位图中不可区分。这是显式的本地表示约定；标准资源类在比较不同编码时仍需核对输入编码与闭包，不能直接把原书所有一致性等式搬到任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 上。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n+1)\">\\(p(n+1)\\)</span> 覆盖空串边界；与通常多项式界只差有限初值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{