athrm{PAdvice}}\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell_f\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\mathrm{bin}(n),\\mathrm{bin}(i)\\rangle\\mid n,i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i<|f(n)|\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\mathrm{bin}(n),\\mathrm{bin}(i)\\rangle\\mid n,i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i<|f(n)|,\\ f(n)[i]=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}(C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\substack{f\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\\\\\ell_f,\\mathrm{Bit}_f\\in D}}\\operatorname{Adv}(C,f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\langle x,f(|x|)\\rangle:x\\in L\\}\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"C,D","display":false},{"tex":"p(n+1)","display":false}],"bytes":3370,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-polynomial-advice]]、[[29-prop-advice-properties]] — 多项式建议、受限一致性及不可判定语言见证"},{"id":"575d4fea7f098cfb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[29-df-polynomial-advice]] 的 $\\mathbb B,C/\\mathrm{poly},\\mathrm{PAdvice},\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}$ 和配对编码。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-polynomial-advice]]"}],"outgoing":["1dacc2eff0f3c359"]}